<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>AbregoTech LISCORE — Centro de Control de Servidores e Infraestructura</title>
  <hta:application
    id="AbregoTechServerCenter"
    applicationname="AbregoTech Server Center"
    border="thin"
    borderstyle="normal"
    caption="yes"
    icon=""
    maximizebutton="no"
    minimizebutton="yes"
    showintaskbar="yes"
    singleinstance="yes"
    sysmenu="yes"
    windowstate="normal"
    scroll="yes"
  />
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background: #030712;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 24px;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    .header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25);
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .brand-box {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .logo-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #06b6d4, #3b82f6, #10b981);
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #030712;
    }
    .title-main {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .title-main span {
      color: #22d3ee;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.5);
    }
    .title-sub {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .global-status-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
    }
    .pulse-dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #10b981;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px #10b981;
    }
    .pulse-text {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #34d399;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    /* Grid de Servicios */
    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .service-card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #090f24, #0f172a);
      border: 1px solid rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.7);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .service-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
    }
    .card-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .service-name {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .badge-port {
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
      color: #22d3ee;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .badge-ok {
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
      color: #34d399;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .service-desc {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .service-metrics {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-family: monospace;
      color: #64748b;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.4);
      padding-top: 8px;
    }
    .service-metrics strong {
      color: #38bdf8;
    }

    /* Acciones Ejecutivas */
    .controls-panel {
      background: #090f24;
      border: 1px solid rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.8);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .panel-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .btn-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .btn {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #06b6d4, #0284c7);
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    }
    .btn-success {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .btn-danger {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #e11d48);
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .btn-portal {
      background: #1e293b;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
      color: #e2e8f0;
    }
    .btn-portal:hover {
      background: #334155;
      border-color: #38bdf8;
      color: #38bdf8;
    }

    /* Consola de Telemetría */
    .telemetry-console {
      background: #020617;
      border: 1px solid rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.9);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      font-family: 'Consolas', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-height: 180px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      box-shadow: inset 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    }
    .log-line {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .log-time {
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .log-ok {
      color: #34d399;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .log-info {
      color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .log-notice {
      color: #fbbf24;
    }
  </style>
  <script language="JScript">
    var shell = new ActiveXObject("WScript.Shell");
    var fso = new ActiveXObject("Scripting.FileSystemObject");

    function getProjectDir() {
      // Obtiene la ruta del proyecto
      var path = location.pathname;
      if (path.charAt(0) === "/") path = path.substring(1);
      return fso.GetParentFolderName(path);
    }

    function addLog(type, msg) {
      var consoleDiv = document.getElementById("logContainer");
      if (!consoleDiv) return;
      var now = new Date();
      var timeStr = ("0" + now.getHours()).slice(-2) + ":" + ("0" + now.getMinutes()).slice(-2) + ":" + ("0" + now.getSeconds()).slice(-2);
      
      var line = document.createElement("div");
      line.className = "log-line";
      var colorClass = type === "OK" ? "log-ok" : (type === "INFO" ? "log-info" : "log-notice");
      line.innerHTML = "<span class='log-time'>[" + timeStr + "]</span> <span class='" + colorClass + "'>[" + type + "]</span> " + msg;
      consoleDiv.appendChild(line);
      consoleDiv.scrollTop = consoleDiv.scrollHeight;
    }

    function startAllServices() {
      try {
        var dir = getProjectDir();
        addLog("INFO", "Iniciando todos los motores en modo silencioso y seguro...");
        shell.Run("wscript.exe //B \"" + dir + "\\server\\launch-silent.vbs\"", 0, false);
        addLog("OK", "PostgreSQL 16.15 & PostgREST :8000 iniciados sin ventanas.");
        addLog("OK", "Middleware ACE :5100 iniciado sin ventanas.");
        addLog("OK", "Enrutador de Portales :3001, :3002, :3003 activo.");
        addLog("OK", "Servidor LISCORE :3000 listo en segundo plano.");
      } catch (e) {
        addLog("WARN", "Error al iniciar: " + e.message);
      }
    }

    function stopAllServices() {
      try {
        var dir = getProjectDir();
        addLog("WARN", "Deteniendo todos los servicios LISCORE...");
        shell.Run("cmd.exe /c \"" + dir + "\\DETENER_SISTEMA.bat\"", 0, true);
        addLog("OK", "Todos los procesos han sido cerrados limpiamente.");
      } catch (e) {
        addLog("WARN", "Error al detener: " + e.message);
      }
    }

    function restartAllServices() {
      stopAllServices();
      setTimeout(function() {
        startAllServices();
      }, 1500);
    }

    function openUrl(url) {
      try {
        addLog("INFO", "Abriendo enlace en navegador: " + url);
        shell.Run(url, 1, false);
      } catch (e) {
        addLog("WARN", "Error al abrir URL: " + e.message);
      }
    }

    window.onload = function() {
      window.resizeTo(1020, 740);
      addLog("OK", "AbregoTech Server Center inicializado.");
      addLog("INFO", "Arquitectura Enterprise lista. Cero ventanas negras en ejecucion.");
    };
  </script>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Encabezado Principal -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="brand-box">
      <div class="logo-icon">&#x2695;</div>
      <div>
        <div class="title-main">AbregoTech <span>LISCORE</span> Enterprise</div>
        <div class="title-sub">Centro de Control de Infraestructura On-Premises &amp; Motores Clínicos</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="global-status-badge">
      <div class="pulse-dot"></div>
      <span class="pulse-text">Servicios Operativos</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Grid de Servicios Médicos / Motores -->
  <div class="services-grid">

    <!-- Tarjeta 1: PostgreSQL 16 -->
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="card-top">
        <div class="service-name">
          <span>&#x1F4BE;</span>
          <span>Motor de Base de Datos</span>
        </div>
        <span class="badge-port">PUERTO 5432</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-desc">
        PostgreSQL 16.15 Enterprise con réplica local y almacenamiento cifrado de expedientes.
      </div>
      <div class="service-metrics">
        <span>Estado: <strong style="color:#34d399;">ONLINE</strong></span>
        <span>Tablas: <strong>85 Clínicas</strong></span>
        <span>Relaciones: <strong>101</strong></span>
        <span>Custodia: <strong>Ley 81 Panamá</strong></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tarjeta 2: API PostgREST -->
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="card-top">
        <div class="service-name">
          <span>&#x26A1;</span>
          <span>API Gateway PostgREST</span>
        </div>
        <span class="badge-port">PUERTO 8000</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-desc">
        Motor RESTful nativo de alta velocidad, pool de conexiones y canal reactivo pgrst.
      </div>
      <div class="service-metrics">
        <span>Estado: <strong style="color:#34d399;">LISTENING</strong></span>
        <span>Pool: <strong>10 Slots</strong></span>
        <span>Caché: <strong>4.4 ms</strong></span>
        <span>RPCs: <strong>16 Médicos</strong></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tarjeta 3: Middleware ACE -->
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="card-top">
        <div class="service-name">
          <span>&#x1F52C;</span>
          <span>Middleware ACE Analizadores</span>
        </div>
        <span class="badge-port">PUERTO 5100</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-desc">
        Servicio de interconexión bidireccional ASTM E1394/HL7 para analizadores de laboratorio.
      </div>
      <div class="service-metrics">
        <span>Protocolos: <strong>ASTM / HL7</strong></span>
        <span>Equipos: <strong>Sysmex, Cobas, Mindray</strong></span>
        <span>Transmisión: <strong>Automática</strong></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tarjeta 4: Enrutador Multi-Port -->
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="card-top">
        <div class="service-name">
          <span>&#x1F310;</span>
          <span>Enrutador de Portales Dedicados</span>
        </div>
        <span class="badge-ok">MULTI-PUERTO</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-desc">
        Aislamiento perimetral estricto para Personal, Pacientes, Médicos Referentes y Súper-Admin.
      </div>
      <div class="service-metrics">
        <span>LIS: <strong>:3000</strong></span>
        <span>Pacientes: <strong>:3001</strong></span>
        <span>Médicos: <strong>:3002</strong></span>
        <span>Admin: <strong>:3003</strong></span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Panel de Controles Ejecutivos 1-Clic -->
  <div class="controls-panel">
    <div class="panel-title">
      <span>Controles del Servidor (Sin Pantallas Negras)</span>
      <span style="font-size: 10px; color: #64748b;">Ejecución en segundo plano blindada</span>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="startAllServices()">
        <span>&#x26A1;</span>
        <span>Iniciar Todos los Servicios</span>
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn-success" onclick="restartAllServices()">
        <span>&#x1F504;</span>
        <span>Reiniciar Servidor</span>
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn-danger" onclick="stopAllServices()">
        <span>&#x23F9;</span>
        <span>Detener Todo</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Panel de Accesos a Portales -->
  <div class="controls-panel">
    <div class="panel-title">
      <span>Accesos Directos a las Plataformas Clínicas</span>
      <span style="font-size: 10px; color: #64748b;">Apertura en el navegador predeterminado</span>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn btn-portal" onclick="openUrl('http://localhost:3000')">
        <span>&#x1F3E5;</span>
        <span>Estación LIS / HIS (:3000)</span>
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn-portal" onclick="openUrl('http://localhost:3001')">
        <span>&#x1F464;</span>
        <span>Portal de Pacientes (:3001)</span>
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn-portal" onclick="openUrl('http://localhost:3002')">
        <span>&#x1FA7A;</span>
        <span>Portal de Médicos (:3002)</span>
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn-portal" onclick="openUrl('http://localhost:3003')">
        <span>&#x2699;</span>
        <span>Consola Súper-Admin (:3003)</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Consola de Telemetría y Eventos -->
  <div class="panel-title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
    <span>Registro de Eventos y Diagnóstico del Servidor</span>
    <span style="font-size: 10px; color: #64748b;">Telemetría en tiempo real</span>
  </div>
  <div class="telemetry-console" id="logContainer">
    <div class="log-line">
      <span class="log-time">[SISTEMA]</span> <span class="log-ok">[LISTO]</span> AbregoTech LISCORE Enterprise v2.4 — Infraestructura activa.
    </div>
    <div class="log-line">
      <span class="log-time">[POSTGRES]</span> <span class="log-info">[CONECTADO]</span> PostgreSQL 16.15 en localhost:5432 (Pool 10 conn).
    </div>
    <div class="log-line">
      <span class="log-time">[POSTGREST]</span> <span class="log-info">[CACHE]</span> 85 Relaciones y 16 RPCs cargadas en 4.4 milisegundos.
    </div>
    <div class="log-line">
      <span class="log-time">[MIDDLEWARE]</span> <span class="log-ok">[LISTENING]</span> Analizadores ASTM en espera de paquetes de resultados.
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
